\\\": 819,\\r\\n    \\\"WorkingSetBytes\\\": 71737344,\\r\\n    \\\"PrivateMemoryBytes\\\": 38842368,\\r\\n    \\\"StartTime\\\": \\\"2026-08-22T18:38:12.9488662-04:00\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"Path\\\": \\\"C:\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\SystemApps\\\\\\\\ShellExperienceHost_cw5n1h2txyewy\\\\\\\\ShellExperienceHost.exe\\\"\\r\\n"},{"id":"43aa988015dddd2b3300","path":"E:\\System-Model-Agent-Audit\\local-api\\IDENTITY-BOUNDARY.md","modifiedAt":"2026-08-22T23:57:44.599Z","approxTokens":209,"content":"# Identity-bound recall\n\nRun `./Start-IdentityContextApi.ps1 -Identity local-owner` from PowerShell. It generates a random bearer token only in that PowerShell session if one is not already set, then starts an API bound to `127.0.0.1:4318`.\n\nEvery request must include both headers:\n\n```text\nAuthorization: Bearer <CONTEXT_API_TOKEN>\nX-Context-Identity: local-owner\n```\n\nThe server performs constant-time token comparison and exact identity-label matching before it reads any index. The identity label is explicit proof-of-possession metadata; it is **not** inferred from writing style, model prediction, tokenizer output, device RAM, or VRAM.\n\nKeep the bearer token private. To revoke access, stop the server and start it in a new PowerShell session to generate a new token. The token is not written to the repository or the index.\n"},{"id":"f5efd8e9072290736c0f","path":"E:\\System-Model-Agent-Audit\\local-api\\Start-ContextApi.ps1","modifiedAt":"2026-08-22T23:52:50.097Z","approxTokens":42,"content":"$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\nSet-Location $PSScriptRoot\nnode .\\scripts\\Build-Index.mjs\nnode .\\context\\Build-Corpus.mjs --profile audit\nnode .\\api\\context-server.mjs\n"}]}